From: Aadi Takle <aadiatakle@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 00:46:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] governance: reframe selection target to Timeback-fit + add
 R11 screener (D-015)

Per the GT admissions-director interview (Crystal Martel, 2026-07-23):
- PROJECT_CHARTER: dual-aim mission (Timeback-fit screener + retained counterfactual),
  goals 7-8, reworded non-goals; giftedness necessary, fit is the criterion.
- project-requirements: reframe R5 to capability-and-fit; add R11 (scalable, tunable,
  GT-validated screener); update core success statement + non-requirements.
- D-015 records the reframe (retains lottery/counterfactual per D-008/D-010; 100,000 north-star).
- E-071..E-077 capture the interview evidence.
- TRACEABILITY: R11 coverage row, reframed R5 row, GOV-007 (this work) + RES-012/RES-013.

Brainlift reframe, GT-data validation-study design, and catalog re-orientation are tracked
follow-ups (RES-012/RES-013), not executed this pass.
